Support reports that the queue summary never changes. `Totals` is declared `public struct Totals { public int Open; }`.

```csharp
public class QueueSummary
{
    private readonly Dictionary<string, Totals> _byQueue = new();

    public void RecordOpened(string queue)
    {
        var totals = _byQueue[queue];
        totals.Open += 1;
    }

    public int OpenIn(string queue) => _byQueue[queue].Open;
}
```

No exception is thrown and the dictionary already contains every queue. Why does `OpenIn` never grow?

solution.code:
function declareField(spec) {
  if (spec.type.endsWith('?')) {
    return spec.type;
  }
  if (spec.optional === true) {
    return spec.type + '?';
  }
  return spec.type;
}

